1556
00:57:34,011 --> 00:57:35,180
It was a movie awards ceremony...

1557
00:57:35,181 --> 00:57:36,510
and you received the Entertainer Award?

1558
00:57:36,511 --> 00:57:37,780
They had that award.

1559
00:57:37,781 --> 00:57:39,110
It's an award given to those...

1560
00:57:39,111 --> 00:57:40,450
who are entertainers amongst movie actors.

1561
00:57:40,451 --> 00:57:41,850
Ju Seung sometimes...

1562
00:57:41,851 --> 00:57:44,520
goes to film festivals as a judge.

1563
