Pay attention to his social media.

1564
00:57:46,451 --> 00:57:47,690
- He posts everything. - I do see his posts.

1565
00:57:47,691 --> 00:57:49,021
I just don't press like.

1566
00:57:49,461 --> 00:57:51,161
- You canceled your like. - Gosh.

1567
00:57:51,421 --> 00:57:53,361
He was being all showy on his post.

1568
00:57:53,961 --> 00:57:57,261
